sequenceDiagram
  participant CR as Cron (worker, every 15 min)
  participant BS as BillingStore
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  CR->>BS: runBillingCycle(now)
  BS->>DB: subscriptions active AND next_credit_grant_at <= now
  loop each subscription
    BS->>BS: cycleAction(sub, now)
    alt new month in period
      BS->>DB: credit_expire (key expire:sub:month)
      BS->>DB: credit_grant (key grant:sub:month), move next_credit_grant_at
    else period ended
      BS->>DB: subscription expired, fall back to Free plan
    end
  end
  BS->>DB: orders pending AND expires_at < now -> expired
  Note over BS,DB: Deterministic idempotency keys make double runs safe
